:CMD: config node R0 protocol source-packet-routing srv6 endpoint end-sid 2001:dbe8:1:1:: flavor psp
:CMD: config node R0 protocol source-packet-routing srv6 endpoint end-sid 2001:dbe8:1:2:: flavor usd
:CMD: config node R0 protocol source-packet-routing srv6 endpoint end-sid 2001:dbe8:1:3:: flavor usp
